  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s strike is so powerful your elbow is completely dislocated. This is incredibly painful!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Your arm is useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.MnMZv7ZXoRqoH9dS]{Amputated Parts}) and the pain so severe you suffer a -10 penalty to all Tests for the rest of the encounter. The arm will remain useless until given Medical Attention after the encounter, which requires a <strong>Challenging (+0) Heal</strong> Test, which can be repeated once per day. If successful it’ll count as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)} rather than a lost limb.</p>"
    },
